# Committed on purpose — PUBLIC values only.
#
# The Supabase anon key is safe to ship in a client bundle: it only identifies
# the project and the "anon" role. What it is allowed to do is enforced by
# Row Level Security (see supabase/schema.sql). It is already visible in the
# deployed site's JavaScript, so committing it here changes nothing.
#
# NEVER put the service_role key, the DB password, or any server-side secret
# in this file.
